  <p class="section-label">What We Offer</p>
  <h2>Authentic Practice, Experienced Guidance</h2>

  <p>Inner Flowing brings together Seb's Qigong practice and Jenny's Yoga and Sound Healing into a shared teaching home. We offer studio classes, online sessions and private one-on-one work, individually and together.</p>

  <p>Whether you are drawn to the stillness and precision of Qigong, the depth of therapeutic Yoga and Sound Healing, or the unique combination of these practices working together, you will find classes here that are grounded in authentic tradition and delivered with care.</p>

